# docker-entrypoint.sh (and any future shell script) MUST stay LF -- a
# CRLF shebang line ("#!/bin/sh\r") fails to exec inside the Linux
# container with a cryptic "No such file or directory". This repo lives
# on a Windows dev machine with Git likely set to autocrlf=true, which
# would otherwise silently convert it to CRLF on a future checkout here.
*.sh text eol=lf
